  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can gather information in 1d4 x 10 minutes or as a plan. Revealing this plan is a swift action. When you reveal this plan, you attempt a Diplomacy check to gather information. You can take 10 on this check.</p>\n<p>In addition, when you request someone give you information, you can spend 1 use of skill leverage to goad them into accidentally telling you more than they meant to. That might mean giving you a partial clue even while refusing or spilling a vital tactical detail when they meant to just give you a vague outline of the situation. You cannot coax extra information out of the same person this way again for 24 hours.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/communication#toc27\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
